  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n6(sec2 59° - cot2 31°] + 2/3 × sin 90° - 3 × tan2 56° × y × tan2 34° = y/3\n\n**Formulas used:**\n\ncosec(90°- A) = sec A\n\ntan(90° - A) = cot A\n\ncosec2A- cot2 A = 1\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n6(sec2 59° - cot2 31°] + 2/3 × sin 90° - 3 × tan2 56° × y × tan2 34° = y/3\n\n⇒ 6[sec²(90°- 31°) - cot² 31°] + 2/3 × 1 - 3 × tan²(90°- 34°) × y × tan234° = y/3\n\n⇒ 6[cosec²31°- cot2 31°] + 2/3 - 3 × cot²34°× y × tan234° = y/3\n\n⇒ 6 × 1 + 2/3 - 3 × 1/tan234°× tan234° × y = y/3\n\n⇒ 6 + 2/3 - 3y = y/3\n\n⇒ 20/3 = y/3 + 3y\n\n⇒ 20/3 = 10y/3\n\n⇒ 20 = 10y\n\n**∴ y = 2 **",
